Condition numbers of Ridge feature matrix ranged from 10^13 to 10^15 across all 10 folds. Normal threshold is under 1000. Root cause: ofi, ofi_10s, ofi_30s, ofi_1m, ofi_5m, ofi_10m are nearly perfectly correlated at 10s bar frequency — longer horizon OFI is just a rolling sum of shorter horizon OFI. Ridge regularisation cannot fully compensate at this severity. Feature selection (VIF + correlation pruning) is required before any meaningful IC can be estimated.

