**Limitation 5 — Holding period mismatch:**
OFI signal horizon is 1-5 minutes. Optimal holding period for cost survival is 30 minutes. Signal decays between 5 and 30 minutes — regime conditioning and larger portfolio size would allow shorter holding periods.

